# Employee Management System

The Employee Management System is a Python-based project that uses SQLite to manage employee information. 

It provides two roles: Admin and Employee. 

The Admin can add, view, search, update, and delete employee details, and manage leave requests.
Employees can view their personal profiles, apply for leave, and check leave status. 
 
 
 This project helps reduce manual work and makes employee data management easier and more efficient.